# Debian packages that the r0b0tlab runtime stage adds to the CUDA runtime image
# (apt-get install ca-certificates libgomp1 gcc libc6-dev, with its full closure).
# Versions are the ones in the local build of that recipe. The first line names the
# snapshot.ubuntu.com timestamp that serves all of them. docker/base/lock.py
# resolves each package=version there and writes sources.lock.
